//! tr kodlu 2 dil=en
// Error 23 — continue outside a loop.
// Message code: H0100
// What happens: The program does not run at all; the message says continue can only be used inside a loop.
// Why: continue and break belong to loops.
// Fixed version:
//     for i in 1..=3 {
//         if i == 2 { continue }
//         print(i)
//     }
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/23_continue_outside_loop.tr   (exit code 1)

G100("first")
A014
